{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "54d2ce65ffa7d999e135f4d64062c3ef74018307757ec521b1da1b859adff471", "ja": "（39プロジェクトの発足に併せて、\nあずささんの宣材写真も撮り直すことになった）", "zh": "（为了配合39PROJECT的开始，\n梓小姐的宣传照也要重拍。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ce95ec41d51a5f5b6eb45e22be938488dccfcff54b6168d92329302b47d25729", "ja": "（とはいえ、今のあずささんには経験がある。\n撮影は順調に進み、いい写真を撮ることができた）", "zh": "（不过现在的梓小姐已经累积了相关经验。\n拍摄相当顺利，成功拍出了好照片。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "af530228b3f7073a8d4a8acf16e34188dcf2f50531da2e79d682ec8a1d6f487b", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\n先ほどの写真、見せてもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生，\n可以让我看看刚才拍的照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fcb3e85c8438c4c1a9d8287d4c180ca22a336e8a826db895679869af5d1abbab", "ja": "もちろんです。\n今、データをお見せしますね。", "zh": "当然可以。\n我现在就让你看档案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "8ab49b90b9b45b4cc366965c10c5dfb65b139458a10b3832a86313ffa856b683", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n……まぁ、これが今日の写真……。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n……嗯，这就是今天拍的照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "75137305326bfd14d534bad5fe0e2eafbfc2d4e849efe60710efa4af619ae89f", "ja": "どうですか？", "zh": "你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "411e883118d95d061bf740ec7d1156b0b2eacbf457ff30f95da292116ba6b9da", "ja": "とってもステキです～。\nこんなに上手に撮ってもらえるなんて……。", "zh": "拍得好棒～\n居然把我拍得这么好看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "0a42d280e0a1e05877ded7956ad79d5c302c109bc8dcd461e1517e205cda26d3", "ja": "なんだか申し訳ないくらいです。\nこれも、カメラマンさんのおかげですね♪", "zh": "总觉得挺不好意思的。\n这也是多亏了摄影师呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "036dfa61d60765559535b1065b55562a6f15871a9687cca818ab62e5f7268cbf", "ja": "撮影中もたくさん声を掛けてもらえて。\nとっても楽しかったです。", "zh": "拍照时摄影师也一直跟我搭话，\n我拍得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e8177e99f037cb850d793e3df35d5f48f5df44b1df5fbbbbc4703a5e4aa6c8bf", "ja": "俺はモデルの勝利だと思いますけど。\nとにかく、気に入ってもらえてよかったです。", "zh": "我倒认为这是模特儿的功劳啦。\n总之，你喜欢就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7b6e157f241cc2dec0b7a2606718167024606700b1bec414602f1b0291f860ab", "ja": "あ、こっちの写真も、\nなかなかいいと思いませんか？", "zh": "啊，这张照片，\n你不觉得也挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "f6ffa44f14b89070f884321ffb3c25395e37feea9fe2a62d6034fb170a16ba22", "ja": "まぁ、本当ですね。\nこの写真も綺麗に撮れて……。", "zh": "哎呀，真的耶。\n这张照片也拍得很漂亮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "a9fd367c277d7247c2c4f99becb5c8ad5147bac33ffcc2731edc3797eed31960", "ja": "ふふっ、なんだか綺麗すぎて、\nお見合い写真みたいです。", "zh": "呵呵，感觉拍得太漂亮了，\n好像相亲照一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e3d89c5ddad3e4c488d13e80aee605c361c26958fcc26a92736c02d67a7cd135", "ja": "はは、お見合い写真ですか？\nそれは……。", "zh": "哈哈，相亲照是吗？\n这一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_1014", "source_sha256": "222d3374ccc5814eb8d5d7e4a1b4b4d112a1cf1700246a73eedbb6cdb2556ae2", "ja": "その通りですね", "zh": "你说得没错", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "2385cb7d0b16f05b80115fbad80c63ec82bbb5311f9819b569276755a44dba4c", "ja": "ある意味、その通りですね。\nアイドルの写真は、そういうものかもしれません。", "zh": "就某种意义上来说，你说得没错。\n偶像的照片或许也有异曲同工之妙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2001_010azu", "source_sha256": "da3c08f9f748ffc046ee391896de6b9569b20829b13afab84dc68547de2db8e2", "ja": "アイドルの写真は……。\nあ、そうかもしれません。", "zh": "偶像的照片……\n啊，或许就是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2002_010azu", "source_sha256": "26b170d9c4461503f652047ac8ed60586e691b2a1f77e21722c7085b75e3302d", "ja": "アイドルは、ファンのみなさんと\nお見合いを繰り返してるようなもの……。", "zh": "当偶像，就像是反复地和粉丝们相亲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2003_010azu", "source_sha256": "cea2663530e37c61fced08e5ab5675473c6636416d4d7d7895fae39c7ab30b70", "ja": "いつでも、その時の1番素敵な姿を\n見てもらえるようにしないといけませんものね♪", "zh": "因为无论何时，\n都要在当下把最棒的状态展现给粉丝们嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2004_p", "source_sha256": "1d464d7a204b8b97f329a0c95ee827498640effdae263a7db8525ae1e1c67606", "ja": "そして今度は、新シアターでのお見合い、\nということになります。", "zh": "而这次就等同是要在新剧场相亲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2005_010azu", "source_sha256": "ccf145107a1f8ac243845660fd96f6593104fe8ffb9959aba6c8727f0024ab2c", "ja": "はい♪　写真を見た後は、\nライブでご対面。", "zh": "是啊♪\n先看过照片后，再在演唱会上见面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2006_010azu", "source_sha256": "742b1fda46481acd491d40044399291c404757ab8070740c963a2dac8d09a59b", "ja": "ふふっ、本当のお見合いの予定は、\nちっとも決まりませんけれど。", "zh": "呵呵，虽说真正的相亲\n倒是完全没安排好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2007_p", "source_sha256": "3474aefb7de9e94806a8672847285751019ad8b3ad6e37cf64fe88780b8e6417", "ja": "えっ。ま、まさか、\n相手を探していたりするんですか？", "zh": "咦？该、该不会，\n你在找对象吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2008_010azu", "source_sha256": "b1bbd68128952e80df04b21da44a35bf4ee0e3a7cda834e07ff046351d1d26e0", "ja": "いいえ、少しも。特に今は、すてきな後輩が\nたくさんできたばかりですし……。", "zh": "不，完全没有。\n尤其现在我才刚有了许多很棒的后辈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2009_010azu", "source_sha256": "f7a4ff2923477639a9d2d2cf55ccb3fd1ced57c475b9246f0bfb4be73adb5f3f", "ja": "私、まだまだアイドルを頑張りたいって\n思ってます♪", "zh": "我目前还想继续努力当偶像♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2010_010azu", "source_sha256": "7d7c15a625d6bcd4ef5cb632736add1f9983dbe163d9965d810e19e8892e60a2", "ja": "ですから、{$P$}さん。\nこれからも、よろしくお願いしますね～。", "zh": "所以说，{$P$}先生。\n以后也请你多多指教喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2011_p", "source_sha256": "77ef12122a34cfb1dd6f914b26f7637b59860743dd6a8c97929980c1e4e11255", "ja": "よかった、安心しました……もちろんです。\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "太好了，我放心了……那当然。\n彼此彼此，也请你多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_010azu_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_010azu_002_2012_p", "source_sha256": "84ab5ed16a496ddbb95f8f3eff9045af539b3d0dd6eb3e4b530ded15ebeeade1", "ja": "（これからも、たくさんの人があずささんと出会う\nことになる……。今日の写真はその鍵になるはずだ！）", "zh": "（今后也会有很多人和梓小姐相遇……\n今天拍的照片会成为关键的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
